msgid "Cleanup and supporting contracts"
msgstr "Takarítás és támogató szerződések"

#: ../../technical/articles/111-core-configuration-profile-selection-and-durable-writes.md:32
msgid ""
"`async_cleanup.py` shields one retained cleanup task until terminal state"
" despite repeated caller cancellation. It retries individual closes when "
"requested, retains failed resource owners for another attempt, and "
"attaches cleanup failures to the active body exception or cancellation "
"rather than replacing the primary failure. Merge helpers preserve "
"distinct owners as errors pass through nested scopes. "
"`auth_session_keys.py` provides profile- and provider-partitioned logical"
" object keys for encrypted session storage rather than plaintext "
"destinations. Strict base64 decoding rejects invalid characters and "
"padding; canonical decoding also rejects alternate spellings of identical"
" bytes. The auth-provider description, metadata-invocation recognizer, "
"and Click-context helpers provide shared typed readiness and output-mode "
"facts, including JSON flags held by either upstream Click or Typer’s "
"vendored context chain. async_cleanup.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/async_cleanup.py`) async_cleanup.py "
